{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>To Migdal Eder.</b> A place near Efrat, as it is written in Micah: 'And you, Bet Lechem Efratah.' And it is written immediately afterward: 'And you, Migdal Eder.' Another interpretation: therefore she was not buried in the cave, because Esau was still disputing it; but once Jacob came, Esau went away and released everything to Jacob."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:26.966441230Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}